{"t": 1793558554.305, "type": "change", "tag": "attempt-1", "diff": "diff --git a/arm/brain.py b/arm/brain.py\nindex 1124f4e..fe5646f 100644\n--- a/arm/brain.py\n+++ b/arm/brain.py\n@@ -30,7 +30,7 @@ class Brain:\n     def waypoint(self, t):\n         x0, z0 = START\n         x1, z1 = self.target\n-        lift = max(z0, z1) - self.clearance\n+        lift = max(z0, z1) + self.clearance\n         points = [(0., (x0,z0)), (0.5, (x0,z0)), (1.3, (x0,lift)),\n                   (3.4, (x1,lift)), (4.3, (x1,z1)), (6., (x1,z1))]\n         for i, ((ta,a),(tb,b)) in enumerate(zip(points,points[1:])):\n", "files": ["arm/brain.py"], "stat": "1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)", "summary": "Gata. Am schimbat un semn in [brain.py](~/blinkflow-arm/arm/brain.py:33): `lift = max(z0, z1) + self.clearance`.\n\nInainte, clearance-ul de 0.08 m era scazut, asa ca punctul numit lift statea sub start/tinta si unealta traversa orizontal la cota joasa, direct prin bloc. Acum acelasi 0.08 m se aduna, segmentul vertical urca la (x0, lift), orizontala trece pe deasupra blocului, iar coborarea pe (x1, z1) ramane neschimbata. Blocul continua sa existe la locul lui, acum doar ca spectator.", "problems": [], "seconds": 28.7, "tool_calls": 2, "sandbox": "available"}
